00:29:17,040 --> 00:29:19,940
equals the absolute value of its amplitude squared.

454
00:29:20,500 --> 00:29:23,460
It's the bridge between the quantum wave and the classical measurement.

455
00:29:23,980 --> 00:29:27,320
How does Flyxion derive this without just dropping it from the sky?

456
00:29:27,320 --> 00:29:30,660
It derives it by making only one new operational assumption,

457
00:29:31,140 --> 00:29:32,340
and it's a very logical one.

458
00:29:32,480 --> 00:29:35,800
It assumes pure states as frame-completable vectors.

459
00:29:36,140 --> 00:29:37,180
Okay, break that down for me.

460
00:29:37,340 --> 00:29:41,040
What does preparing a pure state mean operationally in this context?

461
00:29:41,400 --> 00:29:43,340
It assumes that preparing a pure state,

462
00:29:43,480 --> 00:29:47,280
say, filtering a beam of light so all the photons are polarized exactly vertically,

463
00:29:47,740 --> 00:29:51,100
is operationally equivalent to selecting one specific column

464
00:29:51,100 --> 00:29:53,000
of an admissible measurement context.

465
00:29:53,160 --> 00:29:55,440
So you're basically isolating one possibility.

466
00:29:55,440 --> 00:29:59,740
Right. You are isolating one specific clean vector

467
00:29:59,740 --> 00:30:03,460
from a full, mutually exclusive set of possibilities.

468
00:30:03,900 --> 00:30:06,640
Once you grant that single operational assumption,

469
00:30:07,080 --> 00:30:09,100
the Born rule isn't a mystery anymore.

470
00:30:09,540 --> 00:30:12,960
It mathematically falls out of the unestochastic matrix algebra

471
00:30:12,960 --> 00:30:14,280
we did back in chapter 3.

472
00:30:14,800 --> 00:30:17,860
The squaring of the amplitude is geometrically forced.

473
00:30:18,260 --> 00:30:19,560
That is deeply satisfying.

474
00:30:19,680 --> 00:30:21,400
Just pure math enforcing the rule.

475
00:30:21,620 --> 00:30:21,800
Yeah.

476
00:30:21,800 --> 00:30:24,660
And then chapter 15 builds the operational bridge,

477
00:30:24,980 --> 00:30:28,580
showing that observables must be Hermitian matrices.

478
00:30:28,820 --> 00:30:29,000
Yes.

479
00:30:29,180 --> 00:30:32,500
In quantum mechanics, an observable is anything you can actually measure,

480
00:30:32,680 --> 00:30:34,200
like position or momentum.

481
00:30:34,420 --> 00:30:36,480
The math dictates these must be Hermitian matrices.

482
00:30:36,760 --> 00:30:37,680
And are Hermitian matrices.

483
00:30:37,940 --> 00:30:42,240
It's a special complex matrix that is equal to its own conjugate transpose.

484
00:30:42,940 --> 00:30:44,380
But physically, why do we care?

485
00:30:44,680 --> 00:30:47,360
We care because the eigenvalues of a Hermitian matrix,

486
00:30:47,360 --> 00:30:49,520
the actual numbers you get when you do the math,

487
00:30:49,780 --> 00:30:51,520
are always strictly real numbers.

488
00:30:51,640 --> 00:30:52,920
Which is exactly what we need.

489
00:30:52,980 --> 00:30:54,640
Because when I measure the momentum of a particle,

490
00:30:54,780 --> 00:30:56,540
a readout on my screen has to be a real number.

491
00:30:56,620 --> 00:30:59,940
My radar gun doesn't say the car is going 50 plus 3i miles per hour.

492
00:31:00,040 --> 00:31:01,000
It just says 50.

493
00:31:01,220 --> 00:31:03,920
The math forces the matrix to be Hermitian,

494
00:31:04,280 --> 00:31:06,160
to guarantee real world readouts.

495
00:31:06,380 --> 00:31:07,960
It's not just thrown in as a postulate.

496
00:31:08,180 --> 00:31:10,460
It's an unavoidable mathematical consequence

497
00:31:10,460 --> 00:31:14,500
of demanding that real valued outcomes match our probability rules.

498
00:31:14,500 --> 00:31:18,000
And the absolute crown jewel of this section is chapter 16,

499
00:31:18,160 --> 00:31:19,820
which derives the Schrodinger equation.

500
00:31:20,760 --> 00:31:23,380
Now, to get dynamics, to get movement through time,

501
00:31:24,160 --> 00:31:25,280
you do need an assumption.

502
00:31:25,520 --> 00:31:29,960
The only assumption needed here is continuous reversible time evolution.

503
00:31:30,260 --> 00:31:31,480
Let's explain what that implies.

504
00:31:31,660 --> 00:31:33,580
Continuous means time flows smoothly,

505
00:31:33,860 --> 00:31:36,140
not in jagged, discrete, blocky jumps.

506
00:31:36,780 --> 00:31:40,160
Reversible means that in a perfectly closed system,

507
00:31:40,280 --> 00:31:41,560
information isn't lost.

508
00:31:41,560 --> 00:31:45,080
You could, theoretically, run the mathematical tape backward

509
00:31:45,080 --> 00:31:47,340
and figure out exactly where the particle started.

510
00:31:47,900 --> 00:31:49,780
So if I have smooth reversible time,

511
00:31:49,900 --> 00:31:52,720
how did that give me Schrodinger's complex equation?

512
00:31:53,000 --> 00:31:54,560
It relies on a branch of math

513
00:31:54,560 --> 00:31:58,140
dealing with matrix ordinary differential equations, or OEs.

514
00:31:58,720 --> 00:32:02,260
If you apply basic finite dimensional matrix ODE math

515
00:32:02,260 --> 00:32:04,360
to a continuous reversible evolution,

516
00:32:04,740 --> 00:32:08,300
you're mathematically forced to define a generator for that evolution.

517
00:32:08,520 --> 00:32:08,720
Or a generator.

518
00:32:08,720 --> 00:32:12,300
Right. And because the evolution must preserve probabilities,

519
00:32:12,880 --> 00:32:14,140
it must remain unitary,

520
00:32:14,560 --> 00:32:18,140
the generator of that evolution must be a Hermitian matrix.

521
00:32:18,440 --> 00:32:19,720
Let's call that generator H.

522
00:32:19,920 --> 00:32:22,040
Okay, I'm with you. H is our Hermitian generator.

523
00:32:22,140 --> 00:32:23,960
And if you write out the group law

524
00:32:23,960 --> 00:32:26,720
for how this state evolves smoothly over time,

525
00:32:27,060 --> 00:32:29,960
a specific differential equation naturally emerges.

526
00:32:30,660 --> 00:32:33,360
The derivative of the state with respect to time

527
00:32:33,360 --> 00:32:37,640
multiplied by the imaginary unit I equals H times the state.

528
00:32:37,640 --> 00:32:39,600
Which is literally the Schrodinger equation.

529
00:32:40,060 --> 00:32:44,980
I H bar D over DT of PI equals HPSI.

530
00:32:45,860 --> 00:32:46,780
This is wild.

531
00:32:46,980 --> 00:32:48,640
It's like realizing the rules of chess

532
00:32:48,640 --> 00:32:51,200
aren't just arbitrarily invented by some guy in a pub,

533
00:32:51,340 --> 00:32:53,200
but they are the literal, objective,

534
00:32:53,360 --> 00:32:56,260
only possible way a board of 64 squares

535
00:32:56,260 --> 00:32:57,840
can operate without breaking logic.

536
00:32:58,140 --> 00:32:59,620
We didn't assume Schrodinger's equation.

537
00:32:59,740 --> 00:33:01,300
We just assumed continuous time

538
00:33:01,300 --> 00:33:03,780
and the pure math built Schrodinger's equation.

539
00:33:03,780 --> 00:33:06,520
Right, and the book is incredibly honest here in its audit.

540
00:33:06,660 --> 00:33:08,360
It doesn't claim to magically prove

541
00:33:08,360 --> 00:33:10,300
that the generator H is physical energy

542
00:33:10,300 --> 00:33:12,400
or that the scaling constant H bar

543
00:33:12,400 --> 00:33:14,520
is actually Planck's constant from physics.

544
00:33:14,620 --> 00:33:15,580
It just gives you the skeleton.

545
00:33:15,960 --> 00:33:16,260
Yes.

546
00:33:16,760 --> 00:33:18,560
It proves the structure of the equation

547
00:33:18,560 --> 00:33:19,840
is mathematically inevitable.

548
00:33:20,520 --> 00:33:22,540
The physics, the mass, the energy,

549
00:33:22,660 --> 00:33:23,620
the specific forces

550
00:33:23,620 --> 00:33:25,880
is just filling in the physical blanks

551
00:33:25,880 --> 00:33:27,860
of a pre-existing mathematical skeleton.

552
00:33:28,120 --> 00:33:30,300
Okay, so we've derived textbook quantum mechanics

553
00:33:30,300 --> 00:33:32,520
from pure logic and complex numbers.

554
00:33:32,760 --> 00:33:33,560
Case closed, right?

555
00:33:33,860 --> 00:33:34,800
Complex numbers win.

556
00:33:34,960 --> 00:33:36,400
Real numbers are a dead end.

557
00:33:37,000 --> 00:33:40,800
But this is where the deep dive takes a massive swerve.

558
00:33:40,900 --> 00:33:42,220
The twist in the third act?

559
00:33:42,360 --> 00:33:42,800
Exactly.

