583
00:34:23,220 --> 00:34:24,520
Representation versus structure.

584
00:34:25,140 --> 00:34:27,300
The way we usually combine systems in math,

585
00:34:27,500 --> 00:34:29,480
the way we built that 10th dimension earlier,

586
00:34:29,680 --> 00:34:31,580
is by using the Kronecker product.

