00:34:35,540 --> 00:34:36,740
But the Kronecker product

590
00:34:36,740 --> 00:34:38,480
is just a mathematical convention.

591
00:34:38,920 --> 00:34:41,380
It's a choice of how to represent the combination.

592
00:34:41,720 --> 00:34:42,300
Okay, I'm listening.

