599
00:34:52,520 --> 00:34:54,520
When you multiply a state

600
00:34:54,520 --> 00:34:55,640
by a complex number,

601
00:34:56,140 --> 00:34:58,820
you are doing two geometric operations simultaneously.

602
00:34:59,360 --> 00:35:00,540
You are scaling the amplitude,

603
00:35:00,720 --> 00:35:01,180
